    "https://www.vlerick.com/en/working-vlerick/": {
      "title": "Working @ Vlerick",
      "description": "Working at Vlerick | Vlerick Business School Login Contact About us Jobs en Programme finder Login Programmes Programmes Studying @ Vlerick Learning experience MBA programmes Masters programmes Executive Education Online programmes Doctoral programmes Micro-credentials Programmes by topic Programmes for Entrepreneurs Programmes in Digital Transformation and AI For companies For companies Customised programmes Upskill your employees with Vlerick Our students at your company Partnerships Research for your company Keynote speaker Great Place to Work Research & faculty Research & faculty Find faculty & experts Research strategy Publications Library Events Alumni Alumni Networking & activities Lifelong learning Career & business resources Get involved Support Vlerick’s future Become a member Insights Working @ Vlerick Ready to make a difference in an international, inclusive and entrepreneurial environment? Home Working @ Vlerick Do you dream of an environment where you can grow, take ownership, develop and become part of something bigger? Vlerick is a place where professionals from across the world become entrepreneurial leaders – and are inspired to leap into their future with confidence. We work hard to be a truly diverse, equitable and inclusive place to work and learn. So take the leap and join us! Joining the faculty team We provide a supportive, inspirational and diverse environment for academics from across the globe who want to collaborate, push themselves and excel. As a Professor at Vlerick, you’ll teach at MBA and Masters level – as well as on our executive programmes. And we’ll invest in you – with coaching, case teaching, workshops and training on soft skills. We’ll encourage you to attend international conferences and we’ll support you to get funding. And of course, we’ll connect you to the corporate world. For questions specifically on faculty vacancies, please contact Katelijn Cornelis via katelijn.cornelis@vlerick.com . Discover our vacancies Joining the staff team Whether you join us as a marketeer, a programme manager, a learning designer, administrator or PhD researcher, you’ll find working at Vlerick both challenging and rewarding. You’ll be supported to develop, work autonomously and take on responsibility. You’ll grow professionally, and you’ll have fun. We’re an inclusive, close-knit group that loves to welcome new colleagues into our work family. Join us, and together we’ll support the world’s future entrepreneurial leaders and changemakers. Discover our vacancies Get in touch! Charlotte Mahieu HR Talent Partner charlotte.mahieu@vlerick.com +32 9 210 92 10 Programmes Find your programme Masters programmes MBA programmes Executive education Customised programmes Doctoral programmes Explore Vlerick About us Research & faculty For companies Events Alumni International Office International partnerships Vlerick store Contact us Contact Our campuses Stay connected Newsletter Leading the way Entrepreneurship Digital transformation & AI Accredited by Top ranked Parent universities Cookie preferences Legal Jobs Cookie Control Your choice regarding cookies on this site If you would like to read more about which cookies we use, please view our cookie policy . Accept all Reject all Settings"
