    "https://www.vlerick.com/en/alumni/career-and-business-resources/": {
      "title": "Career and business resources",
      "description": "Career and business resources - Vlerick Alumni | Vlerick Business School Login Contact About us Jobs en Programme finder Login Programmes Programmes Studying @ Vlerick Learning experience MBA programmes Masters programmes Executive Education Online programmes Doctoral programmes Micro-credentials Programmes by topic Programmes for Entrepreneurs Programmes in Digital Transformation and AI For companies For companies Customised programmes Upskill your employees with Vlerick Our students at your company Partnerships Research for your company Keynote speaker Great Place to Work Research & faculty Research & faculty Find faculty & experts Research strategy Publications Library Events Alumni Alumni Networking & activities Lifelong learning Career & business resources Get involved Support Vlerick’s future Become a member Insights Career and business resources How we support individuals and organisations Whether you’re looking for your next role or want to recruit talented alumni, we’re here to help. Home Alumni Career and business resources When you graduate from one of Europe’s most dynamic business schools, you leave with a unique set of tools, skills and approaches. And we’re here to help you put them to the best possible use. So if you’re looking for your next career move, we’re here to help you find it. If you want to recruit one of our talented students or fellow alumni, we’ll help you identify the best candidate. And if you want fresh business insights, we’ll keep you at the top of your game. Hiring? Find your ideal candidate Recruitment Platform: Connect with Vlerick talent 24/7 by posting vacancies on our online job board Career Centre : Discover opportunities to meet our students – through events, working with us on company projects or agreeing to a Talent Partnership Alumni Clubs: Boost your visibility and employer branding by working with one of our clubs Alumni Search : Access our vast alumni network to find fresh talent Applying? Find your ideal role Alumni database : Harness the power of our network to connect with other alumni Recruitment Platform : Connect with top employers and explore current vacancies online Career coaching : Take your career to the next level or steer it in a new direction with individual coaching support Networking events: Connect with employers and peers and share opportunities at one of our many networking events Looking for inspiration? The Vlerick Library is a rich source of the latest business insights and research, whether you’re looking for studies and papers or books. You can browse our databases online, and arrange to pick up books at one of our campuses. Alumni library services Get in touch! Alexandre Segers Head of Corporate Partnerships & Alumni alexandre.segers@vlerick.com +32 9 210 97 32 Programmes Find your programme Masters programmes MBA programmes Executive education Customised programmes Doctoral programmes Explore Vlerick About us Research & faculty For companies Events Alumni International Office International partnerships Vlerick store Contact us Contact Our campuses Stay connected Newsletter Leading the way Entrepreneurship Digital transformation & AI Accredited by Top ranked Parent universities Cookie preferences Legal Jobs Cookie Control Your choice regarding cookies on this site If you would like to read more about which cookies we use, please view our cookie policy . Accept all Reject all Settings"
